{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415664","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415664","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041566401:1":{"text":"여기, 온도, 적당. 씨앗 뿌리기 준비...","source_cn":"这里，温度，适中，准备播种……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BDD90255C489B99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041566402:1":{"text":"이건 촉수인가? 하, 간식거리가 제 발로 들어왔군!","source_cn":"这是触手吗？哈，送上门来的点心！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA52A1FB8A220985","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041566403:1":{"text":"와압... 큭, 퉤! 뭐야, 이건? 나무?","source_cn":"嗷——咳，呸！什么东西，木头？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7E7C318D157490A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041566404:1":{"text":"뿌리와 가지, 먹혔어... 씨앗을 뿌리자.","source_cn":"根和枝，被吞食……播种吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17CC987D8AEE813D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041566405:1":{"text":"...소화... 됐어?","source_cn":"……被……消化了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B3497F940CE13A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041566406:1":{"text":"장난치지 마! 피와 살을 내놔!","source_cn":"别闹了！给我血和肉——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x945A8F28B63AF5F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041566407:1":{"text":"시타가 가진 거, 씨앗, 가지, 잎사귀.","source_cn":"悉达只有，种子，枝，叶。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8C894B5DF044194","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041566408:1":{"text":"재미없군! 위대한 하라크 님은 채식 따위는 하지 않는다!","source_cn":"没劲，伟大的哈拉克大人还没饿到想吃素的地步。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5276D383433723FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041566409:1":{"text":"꺼져라. 멍청한 식물. 이 하라크 님 앞에 그런 보잘것 없는 먹거리를 들이밀지 말란 말이다!","source_cn":"滚吧，没脑子的植物，别往哈拉克大人这里再丢你那些小零嘴了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5894E6C98C92818E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041566410:1":{"text":"...기생 불가. 대상, 식욕, 너무 왕성.","source_cn":"……无法寄生。对象，食欲，过于旺盛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x150171DC369FA68F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041566411:1":{"text":"피와 살, 식욕으로 가득. 삼켜버려, 시타의 씨앗.","source_cn":"连血肉，都充满食欲，会吞噬，悉达的种子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33CC1353A2E3097F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041566412:1":{"text":"거리, 유지.","source_cn":"保持，距离吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE69A486FBBDAF515","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:悉达":{"text":"시타","source":"悉达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:哈拉克":{"text":"하라크","source":"哈拉克","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":2}}